{{provider}} issue tracking is required for eligible changes.

## Rules

- Treat a small bug fix, or a change that is not tracked in OpenSpec when
  OpenSpec is active, as untracked by default.
- Treat an OpenSpec-tracked change that is more than a bug fix as tracked by
  default.
- Follow the user's explicit direction for the current change. A waiver applies
  only to that change and does not alter this project policy.
- If it is not clear whether this change requires tracking, ask the user.
- First reuse an applicable existing issue. Otherwise create one through an
  available {{provider}} integration and allocate it to the active change or
  commit before proceeding.
- If no integration is available, ask the user how to provide or create the
  required issue. Do not invent an identifier.
